The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) costs 650 euros, ex VAT, and includes PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy light ambient lighting, wireless microphones, transport, professional setup, and a live technician for the event. For the full breakdown of what is and isn't included, see our [audio visual rental for weddings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-weddings/) guide, or [questions to ask a wedding rental company](/blog/questions-to-ask-wedding-rental-companies/) before you book.

