## Conclusion

There is no set booking window for wedding AV in Malaga, only availability, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed. Malaga Event Gear delivers, installs and tests the sound, lighting and technician your wedding day needs. [Contact us](/contact/) to check availability for your date.

## FAQs

### How far in advance should I book wedding rentals in Malaga?

There is no fixed rule. What matters is availability for your specific date, which is tighter during peak season (spring through early autumn). Book once your venue and date are confirmed to secure the Wedding Pack and its technician.

### Does booking earlier get me a better price?

No. The Wedding Pack is a flat 650 euros, ex VAT, regardless of how far ahead you book. Booking early affects availability, not price.

### Is the technician available on any date I choose?

Availability depends on the date, same as the equipment itself. The Wedding Pack includes a live technician on site throughout the event. Confirm availability for your specific date as early as you can.

### What if I need to change my wedding date after booking?

[Contact us](/contact/) as soon as a date changes. We will confirm whether the new date is available for the Wedding Pack and technician.

### What's included in the Wedding Pack?

PA sound for up to 80 guests, fairy light ambient lighting, wireless microphones, transport, setup and a live technician. See our [audio visual rental for weddings](/blog/audio-visual-rental-for-weddings/) guide for the full breakdown.
